DE  IS RANDOM                                        \n50:                   RECORD KEY   IS FD-DISCGRP-KEY                                \n51:                   FILE STATUS  IS DISCGRP-STATUS.                               \n52:                                                                                 \n53:            SELECT TRANSACT-FILE ASSIGN TO TRANSACT                              \n54:                   ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL                                    \n55:                   ACCESS MODE  IS SEQUENTIAL                                    \n56:                   FILE STATUS  IS TRANFILE-STATUS.                              \n57:                                                                                 \n58:       *                                                                         \n59:        DATA DIVISION.                                                           \n60:        FILE SECTION.                                                            \n61:        FD  TCATBAL-FILE.                                                        \n62:        01  FD-TRAN-CAT-BAL-RECORD.                                              \n63:            05 FD-TRAN-CAT-KEY.                                                  \n64:               10 FD-TRANCAT-ACCT-ID             PIC 9(11).                      \n65:               10 FD-TRANCAT-TYPE-CD             PIC X(02).                      \n66:               10 FD-TRANCAT-CD                  PIC 9(04).                      \n67:            05 FD-FD-TRAN-CAT-DATA               PIC X(33).                      \n68:                                                                                 \n69:        FD  XREF-FILE.                                                           \n70:        01  FD-XREFFILE-REC.                                                     \n71:            05 FD-XREF-CARD-NUM                  PIC X(16).                      \n72:            05 FD-XREF-CUST-NUM                  PIC 9(09).                      \n73:            05 FD-XREF-ACCT-ID                   PIC 9(11).                      \n74:            05 FD-XREF-FILLER                    PIC X(14).                      \n75:                                                                                 \n76:        FD  DISCGRP-FILE.                                                        \n77:        01  FD-DISCGRP-REC.                                                      \n78:            05 FD-DISCGRP-KEY.                                                   \n79:               10 FD-DIS-ACCT-GROUP-ID           PIC X(10).                      \n80:               10 FD-DIS-TRAN-TYPE-CD            PIC X(02).                      \n81:               10 FD-DIS-TRAN-CAT-CD             PIC 9(04).                      \n82:            05 FD-DISCGRP-DATA                   PIC X(34).                      \n83:                                                                                 \n84:        FD  ACCOUNT-FILE.                                                        \n85:        01  FD-ACCTFILE-REC.                                                     \n86:            05 FD-ACCT-ID                        PIC 9(11).                      \n87:            05 FD-ACCT-DATA                      PIC X(289).                     \n88:                                                                                 \n89:        FD  TRANSACT-FILE.                                                       \n90:        01  FD-TRANFILE-REC.                                                     \n91:            05 FD-TRANS-ID                       PIC X(16).                      \n92:            05 FD-ACCT-DATA                      PIC X(334).                     \n93:                                                                                 \n94:        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.                                                 \n95:                                                                        